C3  THE m-DEPENDENT TIES: the dark mass each simple monomial needs (m is DECLARED, so a tie only moves the fit into m)
======================================================================================================================
    eps/m^2 = (hbar sqrt(G rho_L)/m c^2)^0.25  -> m = 3.59e-11 eV at 575 km/s
    eps/m^2 = (m/M_Pl)^0.25                    -> m = 1.40e+05 eV at 575 km/s
    eps/m^2 = (hbar sqrt(G rho_L)/m c^2)^0.333333 -> m = 6.60e-17 eV at 575 km/s
